  "description": "*“It’s not the CEO’s child.”*\n\nNoh Hye-Ji, a dirt spoon who is bitter about being homeless. But I’m a guide spoon! And I’m a S-class contact guide. I’ve been working as the dedicated guide and secretary for Han Kang-Hyun, the strongest S-class esper in existence, and I’ve been saving money for 6 years. Ta-da, I’m pregnant!\n\n\\[If A neglects contraception and becomes pregnant with B’s child, this contract will be terminated as soon as B finds out.\\]\n\n\\[B can claim damages from A for violating this clause.\\]\n\nSo that means the CEO just needs to not know?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
